# The YuNet face-detection model, pinned.
#
# Not committed as a blob: opencv/opencv_zoo owns it and serves it via git-lfs.
# This repository names the commit and the checksum, and the image build fetches
# exactly this revision and refuses anything else -- the same rule the
# agent-index client follows, because a model is code the detector executes.
#
# A commit sha, never a branch: a moving reference substitutes an unreviewed
# model under the tool that decides where a clip is framed. The checksum is the
# second half of that guard, since an LFS host is only as trustworthy as the
# bytes it returns.
sha=f12e12798e8314f7c074a6656816c048dcc95b7a
sha256=8f2383e4dd3cfbb4553ea8718107fc0423210dc964f9f4280604804ed2552fa4
path=models/face_detection_yunet/face_detection_yunet_2023mar.onnx
